Each leap lands a whole model under the gate of #/rulings (2026-11-11, the leaps run in flowstate); its law lives in the carrier it names, and this section keeps the order and the items still owed. Landed work reads in git and the CHANGELOG; the lanes in flight and their heads read in <<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/controller-handoff#/state`>>; #/the-order ranks every leap still owed.

