!! Stride 3 Bake

The one labelled re-bake and rename, followed by the founding format cut.

''Reading note'': the tree and git decide what stands (#/the-loops). Each item names the shape the tree holds today and what stays owed on it; landed work reads in git and #/ashes.

!!! Seven-league stride notes

* ''Integrity owed: the bake's cross-product'' (`X0`, touching `K15` step 6, `W26`, `G37`). Its witness: one matrix over the pre-bake and post-bake artifacts, every old CID refused after the bake and a fresh two-of-two founding standing, rather than greens read item by item.
* ''Integrity owed: the habit flip at the bake'' (`X0`, `G37`). Before the bake the house runs re-genesis freely, since no CRDT document survives; after it, a re-genesis costs every CID a second operator pins. Its witness: a census of each instrument, fixture, brief and runbook line that assumes a free re-genesis, each named to flip or retire inside the bake's own commit, never after it.

!!! The items

* `G37` The evergreen sweep of 2026-10-18 (<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/research/evergreen-sweep-2026`>>, its six rulings and fourteen lanes). Standing: the witness `tools/evergreen-boundary.mjs`, its per-rule ceilings, which only come down, living in that file and nowhere in prose; the engine watch reading an engine by its sha256; worldline replay ordering by parent links and handle dependencies and naming every skip; `bytesEqual`, `constantTimeBytesEqual`, a strict `hexToBytes` and `nexusAidOfPin` in `@lararium/mesh`; and no version literal in any preimage or format (#/the-leaps, leap 0). Owed: (3) opaque ids, the mount nonce, optional display times, and the clock sinks at effect-record, residency-actions, sense-sensorium, handler-args, wiki-behavior, verb-tiddler and vessel-mailbox; (4) the engine watch by CID, the `LarDoc` and session-envelope shapes, the floor announcement's kind and the browser store's current shape; the mempalace KG still drops `parentKey` when it persists and the CLI tree's sequential mark still reads recorded times, each exception naming its rule, file, line, count and reason. Each lane red-first under a clock set to 1970 and to 3000. G.
