* ''The code lane.'' False source comments (`G6` of #/after-the-seat); callers that still mount a layer default-writable (`operator-daemon-behavior.ts`, `daemon-vm-core.ts`). Tests outside the type-check ride the test-typecheck ratchet, whose ceilings only fall (`G61`, #/ashes).
